# Route: guide 17 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to 35, 47
# quests, 3.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thousand Needles, Hillsbrad Foothills, The Barrens, Orgrimmar, Swamp
# of Sorrows, Loch Modan): Freewind Post -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Freewind
# Post -> Darkcloud Pinnacle -> Camp E'thok -> Freewind Post -> Windbreak
# Canyon -> Splithoof Crag -> The Shimmering Flats -> Freewind Post -> Tarren
# Mill -> Durnholde Keep -> Tarren Mill -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Gahz'rilla (2770), The Grave Knight (96986), Willix the
# Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate
# Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981),
# Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The
# Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the Lost Satchel
# (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying the Beast
# (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697), Changing Tastes
# (95697).

